{"root":{"data":{"id":"dm6d5kxzhmw0","created":1792164107211,"text":"心血管生理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6o6ynbb1k0","created":1792195247613,"text":"心肌细胞的生物电现象\n和生理特性","layout":null,"note":"心肌不会像骨骼肌那样发生强直性收缩，为什么？\n1.\t电活动特点：心肌动作电位存在 2 期平台期，时程明显长于骨骼肌；\n2.\t不应期特征：心肌有效不应期特别长，一直持续到舒张早期，收缩期内不能再次兴奋；骨骼肌不应期短，可产生动作电位总和；\n3.\t功能意义：避免强直收缩，保证心肌收缩、舒张交替进行，维持心脏泵血。\n\n","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6o8doez5k0","created":1792195358696,"text":"细胞分类","layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6o8j5nwtc0","created":1792195370623,"text":"按快慢反应、\n是否自律","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6o8rj7a280","created":1792195388856,"text":"快反应细胞：\n0期Na⁺内流","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6o9pk9fk00","created":1792195462930,"text":"非自律","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6obdqqj2o0","created":1792195593929,"text":"心房肌、心室肌\n(也称工作细胞)","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6obsba2u00","created":1792195625646,"text":"自律","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6obu7vf2o0","created":1792195629793,"text":"浦肯野纤维\n（潜在起搏细胞）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6o9azi0tk0","created":1792195431200,"text":"慢反应细胞：\n0期Ca²⁺内流","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6oc6q7uv40","created":1792195657024,"text":"非自律","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ocecevuo0","created":1792195673604,"text":"房室结部分细胞\n（慢传导）","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ocq1oivk0","created":1792195699076,"text":"自律","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ocvalchk0","created":1792195710499,"text":"窦房结细胞\n（主导起搏）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6odrfu7ww0","created":1792195780473,"text":"按功能分类","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6odvub1ts0","created":1792195790055,"text":"工作心肌细胞","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6oit93khc0","created":1792196176240,"text":"心房肌\n心室肌","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6oiy8hkwg0","created":1792196187087,"text":"发生收缩","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6oj2alvs80","created":1792196195922,"text":"有稳定的静息电位，不自律","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6odyuaars0","created":1792195796584,"text":"自律心肌细胞","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ojbe2sag0","created":1792196215723,"text":"窦房结\n房室结\n浦肯野纤维","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ojjq7nfs0","created":1792196233871,"text":"产生/传导节律","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ojq5hkh40","created":1792196247855,"text":"静息状态不稳定，可自动去极化","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6oe1thwbk0","created":1792195803067,"text":"非肌细胞","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ok15j5e00","created":1792196271803,"text":"内皮细胞\n成纤维细胞","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ok7itihs0","created":1792196285667,"text":"支持/代谢/纤维化/电耦联环境","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6oki7nmfs0","created":1792196308936,"text":"不直接产生典型的心肌AP","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ol1d3wbk0","created":1792196350625,"text":"心肌细胞的生物电现象","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ol9gjivs0","created":1792196368247,"text":"心室肌细胞","layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6olf14ns00","created":1792196380376,"text":"静息电位","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ols48mbs0","created":1792196408862,"text":"是细胞膜内外两侧的电位差","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6om0320ag0","created":1792196426205,"text":"形成基础：离子分布不均，膜对K⁺的选择性通透","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6omtoe9rk0","created":1792196490622,"text":"k+外流为主因，\n心室肌静息电位约 -90 mV，\n接近K⁺平衡电位","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6onorntuo0","created":1792196558299,"text":"注意：内向整流钾离子通道IK1","resource":["！"],"progress":9,"color":"#ff0000","font-weight":"bold","background":"#ffff00","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6op12dzzc0","created":1792196663433,"text":"作用：稳定心室肌静息电位的重要k+电流","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6opfwvh9k0","created":1792196695752,"text":"内向整流并非k+内流，\n而是强调在去极化时减少k+外流\n（当膜电位去极化（膜电位正值）时，\n胞内镁离子与多胺堵塞通道孔道，\n抑制K⁺外向外流）","font-weight":"bold","color":"#ff0000","background":"#c6d9f1","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6oqlqkghs0","created":1792196786795,"text":"动作电位","layout":null,"image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/6ab729c0e3d9f8e20cb344e75b00101b/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":171}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6oqs6xno00","created":1792196800846,"text":"0期：快速去极化","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6or1k4xao0","created":1792196821235,"text":"关键词：快Na⁺内流","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ouasssmg0","created":1792197076442,"text":"主要事件：快Na+通道开放，形成快速去极化","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ouppe6ig0","created":1792197108888,"text":"特点：时间短、幅度大、速度快","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ov29de9c0","created":1792197136217,"text":"过程：\n刺激\n→阈电位（约-70mV）\n→快Na⁺通道激活\n→ Na⁺再生性内流\n→ 膜电位快速上升","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ow67nvdc0","created":1792197223185,"text":"0期上升速度与幅度决定了局部电流的强度","font-weight":"bold","note":"（可兴奋细胞达到阈电位后形成的正反馈式Na⁺内流：去极化本身打开更多电压门控钠通道，钠内流进一步加强去极化，形成自我放大的正反馈过程，也就是再生机制，最终爆发动作电位上升支）","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6owpxtwog0","created":1792197266127,"text":"钠通道的特征","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6owwisacg0","created":1792197280454,"text":"①激活、失活、复活快\n②对钠离子有高度的选择性\n③电压和时间依赖性，阈电位TP：-70mV\n④阻断剂：河豚毒素TTX","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6oqu14nn40","created":1792196804848,"text":"1期:快速复极初期","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ortn4zn40","created":1792196882366,"text":"关键词：Ito介导K⁺短暂外流","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6oz37ws680","created":1792197451763,"text":"过程：\n--快Na⁺通道迅速失活，内向电流减少\n—Ito（瞬时外向钾电流）开放，K⁺短暂外流\n--膜电位出现早期快速复极，即动作电位“切迹”","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6oqvgs2g00","created":1792196807971,"text":"2期：平台期","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6osdjtwyo0","created":1792196925702,"text":"Ca²⁺内流 VS K⁺外流","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6oxtxevjc0","created":1792197353173,"text":"过程：\nL（long-casting）型Ca²⁺通道开放，Ca²⁺缓慢进入细胞\n--K⁺外流（Ik和Ik1）同时存在，二者一段时间内相互对抗\n--平台期延长AP时程，也延长有效不应期\n--Ca²⁺内流同时是兴奋-收缩耦联的重要触发","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ph4ljkyw0","created":1792198865319,"text":"关于K的两个通道","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6phf9h74o0","created":1792198888534,"text":"(Ik1的开放程度仅有静息时的1/5~1/6，\n去极化其开放程度降低，越极化开放程度越高)","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6phf9hpzs0","created":1792198888535,"text":"Ik是延迟整流，平台期快结束时，Ik才打开","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pi05v22o0","created":1792198934028,"text":"阻断剂：锰离子、多种钙通道阻滞剂（如维拉帕米）","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ot68gfiw0","created":1792196988141,"text":"3期：快速复极末期","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6otk0z8nc0","created":1792197018164,"text":"K⁺外流增强","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pi7mdneo0","created":1792198950264,"text":"过程：\n慢Ca2+通道失活+膜对K+通透性增加+IK 通道\n➡K+再生式外流\n➡快速复极化至RP水平","font-weight":"bold","font-style":"italic","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pijzs33k0","created":1792198977195,"text":"Ik1参与后半段的正反馈","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pj91rgy00","created":1792199031735,"text":"Ik(延迟整流电流)：慢、+20mV最大激活，-60mV失活","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6otqwoa7k0","created":1792197033141,"text":"4期：静息期","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ottzed9c0","created":1792197039836,"text":"离子梯度恢复，电位稳定","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pjl5z6n40","created":1792199058111,"text":"钠钾泵、\n钠钙交换体（钙离子逆浓度梯度外运与钠离子顺浓度差内流耦合进行）、\n钙泵——恢复膜两侧的离子分布","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pjtziruo0","created":1792199077312,"text":"属于电中性转运","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pndrakxc0","created":1792199355442,"text":"对于心肌细胞：低钾高钾不但影响浓度差，\n还影响膜通透性（低钾时膜对钾通透性降低，高钾时增大）","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6po6i56fc0","created":1792199418016,"text":"心室肌动作电位与神经元对比","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6pofklyiw0","created":1792199437756,"text":"时程","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6poqxcrw00","created":1792199462471,"text":"神经元：毫秒级、短","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6poyvluso0","created":1792199479780,"text":"心室肌细胞：长、约数百毫秒","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6poirbo2o0","created":1792199444692,"text":"形态","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6pp7do3yo0","created":1792199498286,"text":"神经元：尖峰样","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ppc56pd40","created":1792199508657,"text":"心室肌细胞：有平台期","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pok1enco0","created":1792199447479,"text":"关键离子","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6pphf2zww0","created":1792199520139,"text":"神经元：Na⁺、K⁺为主","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6ppxqm3a00","created":1792199555665,"text":"心室肌细胞：Na⁺、K⁺、Ca²⁺共同参与","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pomq511c0","created":1792199453328,"text":"功能意义","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6pqmy9i7k0","created":1792199610547,"text":"神经元：快速传递信息","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pqrru4w00","created":1792199621043,"text":"心室肌细胞：触发收缩并防止强直","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6prd9jx3k0","created":1792199667826,"text":"心房肌细胞","layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6prjc8a600","created":1792199681049,"text":"与心室肌相似，但它对K+的通透性较大，\n总时程稍短一些","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pt6k9e740","created":1792199809965,"text":"自律细胞","layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6qv0xn4h40","created":1792202775551,"text":"需理解","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6pthtiwpk0","created":1792199834469,"text":"最大复极/舒张期电位MDP：\n3相达到最大极化状态时，表示静息电位值","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6pu3dgcyo0","created":1792199881387,"text":"4相自动除极是自律细胞产生自动节律性兴奋的基础","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6qvol92z40","created":1792202827045,"text":"1.窦房结SAN动作电位","image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/f3b874224f0ecfee79766f4d31c4580e/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":176},"layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r2h1g2cw0","created":1792203359159,"text":"特点","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r2rzubcw0","created":1792203383007,"text":"--最大复极电位约 -70 mV，阈电位约 -40 mV","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r2rzuamo0","created":1792203383007,"text":"--只有0、3、4三个主要时期，无明显1期和2期","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r2rzvdjc0","created":1792203383008,"text":"--0期由Ca²⁺内流主导，上升慢、幅度小","color":"#ff0000","font-weight":"bold","background":"#c6d9f1","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r2rzvb340","created":1792203383008,"text":"--4期自动去极化，是自律性的电生理基础","font-weight":"bold","color":"#ff0000","background":"#c6d9f1","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r2rzv3kw0","created":1792203383008,"text":"窦房结细胞“没有稳定静息电位”，这正是它能自动起搏的根本","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r3gez93k0","created":1792203436165,"text":"涉及的离子流","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r36q65k00","created":1792203415074,"text":"没有Ik1的参与","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r3qjsptc0","created":1792203458224,"text":"在4期自动去极化时","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r43kgths0","created":1792203486562,"text":"①K⁺外流逐渐衰减：膜电位不再维持稳定负值","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r43kgakw0","created":1792203486562,"text":"②If电流（进行性增强的内向电子流，主要为Na+）参与：舒张期去极化斜率的重要调节因素","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r43kgn140","created":1792203486562,"text":"③T型（Transient瞬时）Ca2+电流参与：帮助接近阈值并触发0期","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r43kglq00","created":1792203486562,"text":"T型钙通道特点：快，Ca2+负载；\n阈电位-50~-60mV；\n阻断剂Ni2+；\n电导小因此对0期作用小","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r55wvkk00","created":1792203570031,"text":"Ik延迟整流电流：","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r5gw8u280","created":1792203593937,"text":"慢；K+负载为主；","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r5gw9lfc0","created":1792203593938,"text":"-60mV开始关闭；+20mV最大开放","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r5kk88qo0","created":1792203601918,"text":"If起搏电流","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r5ofrsd40","created":1792203610355,"text":"慢；Na+负载为主；","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r5ofs7cg0","created":1792203610356,"text":"窦房结起搏来自多电流和Ca²⁺电流的共同作用","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r5w21wts0","created":1792203626940,"text":"-60mV开始激活；时间依从性强；-100mV最大开放；","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r5zhg1w80","created":1792203634401,"text":"阻断剂：Cs+;\n对浦肯野细胞作用强于窦房结细胞（因为浦肯野细胞的最大复极电位更大）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r6enre400","created":1792203667435,"text":"相关离子流的阻断剂","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r6w7jn600","created":1792203705636,"text":"","image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/2b3989c64bfc035f5b2746d9639bf02f/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":65},"layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r81154yw0","created":1792203794497,"text":"补充：Cs2+可选择性阻断If","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r89kiv4w0","created":1792203813083,"text":"2.其他自律细胞的AP","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r8ji2p880","created":1792203834703,"text":"浦肯野纤维","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r8n1ofh40","created":1792203842419,"text":"AP与工作细胞基本相似，\n4期自动缓慢去极化（If离子流，可被低浓度铯阻断），\n自我启动、自我发展、自我限制","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r95asfts0","created":1792203882152,"text":"房室结","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6r97hcca00","created":1792203886901,"text":"AP与SAN类似，时程短","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6r9g32ha00","created":1792203905629,"text":"比较心室肌和窦房结","layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6rac4jv680","created":1792203975376,"text":"心室肌细胞","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6rajdegv40","created":1792203991149,"text":"主要任务：强有力收缩","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rajdenrk0","created":1792203991149,"text":"4期：稳定静息电位","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rajdel680","created":1792203991149,"text":"0期离子：Na⁺快速内流","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rajdehv40","created":1792203991149,"text":"平台期：有，决定长ERP","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rajdefbc0","created":1792203991149,"text":"自律性：无","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rajdecsw0","created":1792203991149,"text":"传导速度：较快","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rae3jjvk0","created":1792203979669,"text":"窦房结细胞","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6rawm15ao0","created":1792204019969,"text":"主要任务：发放节律","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rawm1e4w0","created":1792204019969,"text":"4期：自动去极化","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rawm14v40","created":1792204019969,"text":"0期离子：Ca²⁺内流","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rawm22c00","created":1792204019970,"text":"平台期：无明显平台期","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rawm1of40","created":1792204019970,"text":"自律性：强","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rawm1q5s0","created":1792204019970,"text":"传导速度：较慢","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rc9ew90g0","created":1792204126200,"text":"心肌四大生理特性","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6rcglkkx40","created":1792204141841,"text":"自律性","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6ria4pczs0","created":1792204597945,"text":"无外来刺激仍能够自动、节律性兴奋","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6riw3583k0","created":1792204645740,"text":"包含三个内涵","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6rizagjz40","created":1792204652713,"text":"①自动性：无需外来刺激即可发生兴奋；","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rizagqfs0","created":1792204652713,"text":"②频率性：一定时间内自动兴奋次数；","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rizah77k0","created":1792204652714,"text":"③规律性：兴奋发生有稳定的节律","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rj5n2s800","created":1792204666536,"text":"决定因素：","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6rjafk6l40","created":1792204676966,"text":"4期自动去极化速度；","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rjafkmq00","created":1792204676966,"text":"最大复极电位与阈电位的距离","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rjeibvow0","created":1792204685840,"text":"影响因素：\n斜率、距离、神经体液调节","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6rjngx1i00","created":1792204705346,"text":"4期自动去极化速度↑：更快达到阈电位，自律性↑。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rjngx70o0","created":1792204705346,"text":"最大复极电位更负：距阈电位更远，自律性↓。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rjngx96g0","created":1792204705346,"text":"阈电位上移：更难达到，自律性↓。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rjngx9280","created":1792204705346,"text":"儿茶酚胺 ：一般使4期斜率↑，心率↑。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rjngxri80","created":1792204705347,"text":"乙酰胆碱：一般使4期斜率↓，心率↓。","image":"https://p.cldisk.com/star4/586f9adc76c5ca252979e45b936ea2b2/origin.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":158,"height":200},"layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6wxzdqqfk0","created":1792219933923,"text":"自律性的高低，本质上是看4期膜电位到达阈电位的速度","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6wyg6ne000","created":1792219970500,"text":"几个重要概念","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6wypgi4680","created":1792219990686,"text":"（1）主导起搏点和潜在起搏点：","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6wyvs2rk80","created":1792220004447,"text":"主导起搏点：窦房结 P 细胞自律性在心脏自律组织中最高，\n通过抢先占领和超速驱动压抑机制控制心脏的节律活动，\n是心脏正常冲动起源部位，称为主导起搏点，\n由其控制的心律为窦性心律。","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm6x7mhncrk0","created":1792220689503,"text":"细胞：窦房结P细胞"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6x7rxo7z40","created":1792220701356,"text":"自律性：最高"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6x7uioa940","created":1792220706979,"text":"正常功能：产生心脏原发冲动"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6x83redmw0","created":1792220727098,"text":"异常情况：窦房结病变→窦性心动过缓、停搏"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6wyvs396g0","created":1792220004448,"text":"潜在起搏点latent pacemaker：房室交界、房室束、浦肯野纤维等自律组织，\n本身具有自律性，但正常情况下自律性低于窦房结，\n其自动去极化被窦房结传来的冲动所抑制，\n不表现起搏功能，仅起传导作用不表现自身的节律性，\n称为潜在起搏点。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6wyvs3ncg0","created":1792220004448,"text":"异位起搏点ectopic pacemaker：窦房结的兴奋下传\n受阻或潜在起搏点的自律性增高，\n潜在起搏点也可起搏，形成异位起搏点。","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rchz4d7c0","created":1792204144837,"text":"兴奋性","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rcjgcfts0","created":1792204148055,"text":"传导性","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm6rcl45cy80","created":1792204151671,"text":"收缩性","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}